Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.75,0:00:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What secrets hide beneath the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.25,0:00:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,emerald sea of the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.39,0:00:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazon canopy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.63,0:00:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,From high above, the forest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.35,0:00:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,appears as a continuous green
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,roof, a closed canopy that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.85,0:00:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,traps moisture and shelters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,countless epiphytes and lianas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This living roof houses an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,estimated half of all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.97,0:00:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,terrestrial species, making
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.78,0:00:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,rainforests the Earth's greatest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.42,0:00:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,pharmacy, where more than a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.05,0:00:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,quarter of natural medicines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,were first discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.35,0:00:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet the canopy is not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,immune to danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In the dry season of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.32,0:00:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,2019, satellite monitors
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,recorded over 80,000 fires
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.40,0:00:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,across Brazil, a 77 percent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,jump from the previous year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.49,0:00:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and thick smoke even dimmed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.21,0:00:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,distant cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.60,0:00:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Those flames threaten the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazon's role as the planet's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.34,0:00:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,largest carbon sink, a system
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.39,0:00:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,that captures roughly a quarter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.93,0:00:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,of global carbon dioxide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.23,0:00:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,As the sun filters through
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,layers of leaves, each drop
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.36,0:00:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,of rain fuels a cycle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,that sustains climate and life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, the canopy is both
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,a shield and a signal—protecting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.03,0:01:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,biodiversity while warning us of
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.15,0:01:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the fragile balance we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,must preserve.